## Directory Description

| Directory | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `backend/` | Handles APIs, business logic and database operations. |
| `frontend/` | Contains UI components and client-side logic. |
| `api/` | Defines REST API endpoints. |
| `core/` | Contains application configuration and security. |
| `models/` | Defines database models. |
| `services/` | Implements business logic and external integrations. |
| `schemas/` | Handles request and response validation. |
| `tests/` | Contains automated test cases. |
| `infrastructure/` | Deployment and infrastructure configurations. |
| `docs/` | Technical documentation. |

## Technology Stack

- **Backend:** Python, FastAPI
- **Frontend:** React.js, Vite
- **Database:** PostgreSQL
- **Authentication:** JWT
- **Containerization:** Docker
- **Deployment:** Nginx, AWS
